diff --git a/features/app-loading.feature b/features/app-loading.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..94af80e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/app-loading.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+Feature: App loading
+  As a user
+  I want the todo app to load when I open index.html in a browser
+  So that I can interact with the todo interface
+
+  Scenario: The index.html file at the project root loads the todo app structure and application script
+    Given a file "index.html" exists at the project root
+    Then the file contains an input element with class "new-todo"
+    And the file contains a section element with class "main"
+    And the file contains a footer element with class "footer"
+    And the file contains a script tag loading "js/app.js"
